                "line_end": 418,
                "premise_scope": "Qualified cognitive reading with an experiencer and a two-part embedded predication. Certainty or doubt is attributed to that experiencer. Seeing, finding, knowing-as-recognition and accusation are distinct readings. No general rule projects the embedded proposition as a fact; no universal claim that every lexical member lacks factive uses."
